r · Evaluator"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Persistence"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Across Improvement Rounds"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Recursive Reuse"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Demonstrated"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Evidence"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Task Gain · Recursive Reuse · Improver Quality Gain"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"System Boundary"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"Model Weights；以该论文实际可更新组件为边界，固定部分见下方判定。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Feedback"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"model 通过 LLM-as-a-Judge prompt 为候选回答打分，由此形成偏好对并用于迭代 DPO。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"children":"Evidence Scope"}],["$","dd",null,{"children":"这些结果对应有限训练轮数与特定评估；持续改进是否稳定，需要更长周期与独立评价。 已核验固定版本的相关方法与主要结果；未独立复现。"}]]}]]}],"$L10","$L11"]}]]]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}],"$L19"]}]]}]
