1d:["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"沿用原文的开放式 Instruction Following 设置。教学输入是“解释为什么天空呈蓝色”。同一 Model 生成几个回答，并按固定 Rubric 为它们评分，选择高低分答案组成 Preference Pair，DPO 更新 Model。新版再回答和评分。主实验的 Prompt Generator 固定为 Llama 2 Chat 70B；会更新的是用于回答与 Judge 的 Model，不能把整个数据生产链都画成同步演化。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Rewarding Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"用 DPO 理解训练：给定偏好答案 y+ 和非偏好答案 y−，先计算当前 Model 相对 Reference Model 对各答案的 Log Probability 增量，再取差。差越大，表示训练更偏向 y+。Sigmoid 把差转换成 0 到 1 的偏好概率，负对数使错误排序受到较大惩罚。β 控制相对偏移尺度。这优化的是给定 Preference Label；标签本身是否正确，Loss 无法保证。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"s(y) = log πθ(y|x) − log πref(y|x)\nL = −log σ(β·[s(y+) − s(y−)])\nσ(z) = 1 / (1 + exp(−z))"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Rewarding Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}],["$","a","dpo",{"href":"#reference-dpo","aria-label":"来源 3: Direct Preference Optimization: Your Language Model is Secretly a Reward Model","children":["[",3,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"从两个候选理解 DPO。x 是同一个问题，y+ 是被 Judge 偏好的回答，y− 是另一个回答；πθ 是正在训练的 Model，πref 是固定参照。s(y) 衡量相对参照，当前 Model 把这个回答变得多常见。两者相减得到 Preference Margin。初始 Margin 为 0 时，Sigmoid 给 0.5，Loss 约为 0.693；若 β×Margin 变为 2，Loss 约为 0.127。因此，降低 Loss 会把相对概率推向被偏好的回答。这个推力只遵循训练标签：Judge 选错时，同一公式也会强化错误偏好。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Rewarding Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：多轮自评分训练是否改善回答，并改善 Judge？→ Experiment：逐轮比较 Instruction Following，并在独立的人类排序数据上测量判断一致性。→ Answer：作者报告两种能力均有改善。实验支持有限轮次的联合改进，但没有证明自评偏差会随轮数自动消失，也没有对所有后继训练条件进行配对控制。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Rewarding Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"论文在其 instruction following 实验中观察到回答与 reward 判断两方面的改善。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Rewarding Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"这项工作把 Evaluator 也纳入可更新的系统状态。理解它要问三件事：谁提供 Prompt、谁生成答案、谁决定偏好。只说“Model 自己奖励自己”会遗漏固定 Rubric、Seed Data 和训练算法这些外部锚点。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Rewarding Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是同源 Judge 的改进与真实回答质量一致。生成者和 Judge 可能共享事实盲区，或共同偏爱更长、更自信的风格；它们的互相认同上升，并不必然意味着外部用户获得更可靠的信息。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Rewarding Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"这些结果对应有限训练轮数与特定评估；持续改进是否稳定，需要更长周期与独立评价。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Rewarding Language Models · v3","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：在一个小型 Model 上准备独立的事实型 Instruction 与人工核验集。Day 3–5：只做一轮 Preference 构造和 LoRA DPO，另设固定外部 Judge 生成偏好的对照。Day 6–7：盲评正确率、长度与 Judge 排序准确率。最小命题是“自评带来的排序改善能否独立于表达风格”。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"构造事实相同、措辞不同的回答对，再构造措辞相同、事实不同的回答对。让自评训练偏向某种风格，随后交叉替换内容与风格。如果分数主要跟随风格而非事实，便能证伪该设置下 Judge Quality 等同于答案可靠性的假设。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究“可证伪的自奖励”：Judge 对每个偏好决定提出一个能改变其排序的最小外部检查，再让系统选择信息量最高的检查，而非给所有答案追加同等监督。Constitutional AI 提供规范约束，此提案转向识别 Judge 的具体知识盲区。需要比较相同外部检查预算下，主动选择是否降低共享错误；若检查只是重复 Judge 原有理由，机制没有获得新信息。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2212.08073",{"href":"#reference-2212.08073","aria-label":"来源 2: Constitutional AI: Harmlessness from AI Feedback","children":["[",2,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
